N17 - Web Admin (Frontend) - evidence
=====================================
Date: 2026-11-12 (Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh)
Repo: PTPMHDV_Frontend, branch: nguyen
OS: Microsoft Windows 11 Home Single Language (NT 10.0.26200.0)
Node: v24.21.0
npm: 11.19.0
Code SHA (HEAD at test time): f5b7930b72d65745e12efc342da096e51ef9345c
Base SHA (merge-base with origin/main): 02a44baa2dcaa5b916e0168f344625059b146749

Scope of change
---------------
- features/admin restructured to types -> api -> queries (adminKeys factory):
  GET /api/admin/dashboard, GET /api/admin/kyc, POST /api/admin/kyc/:id/review,
  PATCH /api/admin/kyc/:id/tier, GET /api/admin/kyc/:id/documents,
  GET /api/payments/admin/topups, approve, reject.
- Deleted services/adminService.ts and components/KycActionForm.tsx.
- AdminDashboardPage / AdminKycPage / AdminTopupPage are now 7-line thin pages.
- AdminDashboard: real aggregate, numbers via formatNumber, no sample data,
  no setTimeout/Math.random.
- AdminKycManager: paginated queue, status filter, search, detail panel, audited
  document viewer (memory-only URLs), approve/reject with mandatory reason,
  tier change with reason; rejects invalid forms before any request.
- AdminTopupManager: real list, client search, detail dialog, approve/reject
  calling the real routes via isPending-locked buttons; NOT_ALLOWED mapped to a
  Vietnamese explanation because payment-service disables manual ops for VNPAY.
- Tests added: tests/admin.test.ts (node:test API contract, 5 tests) and
  src/test/admin.test.tsx (vitest UI/schema/storage/invalidation, 12 tests);
  tests/auth-api.test.ts updated to adminApi.changeKycTier.
- Docs: docs/handover/admin.md rewritten; docs/CONTRACT_OPEN_QUESTIONS.md gained
  the KYC status-filter mismatch, NOT_ALLOWED behavior, no-Idempotency-Key note
  and the AGENTS.md 6.6 reconciliation conflict.

